Package: lingmo-animation-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Multi-Arch: foreign
Description: Animation primitives for the Lingmo desktop
 A small header-only C++20 library of curves, tweens, smoothing, springs,
 hops and timelines shared by the Lingmo desktop's animations. It has no
 window or toolkit dependency: a driver steps the values with the time that
 passed, so the same primitives run in the shell, the compositor and tests.
